    "summary": "Silver-gilt clasp, in two parts, formed of a central openwork boss with lozenge-shaped pendant hanging from its centre, attached to one of two flanking lozenge-shaped elements, each with a further lozenge-shaped pendant hanging from the centre. The lozenges all have repoussé-work bosses and engraved and chased decoration. At the back a single strip of silver forms the loop and hook.",
